OL,3,CPM 'to explore every option' to block
OL,4,Cearly release of PC Harper's killers
OL,6,FThe prime minister is considering
OL,7,Fblocking PC Andrew Harper's killers
OL,8,Ffrom being released early from prison,
OL,9,Fit has been reported, after he
OL,10,Fpreviously suggested he would not be
OL,11,Fable to keep them behind bars.
OL,13,FPC Andrew Harper, 28, was fatally
OL,14,Finjured in 2019, when he got caught in
OL,15,Fa strap attached to the back of a car
OL,16,Fwhile responding to a quad bike theft
OL,17,Fin Sulhamstead, Berkshire.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
