OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786229319
OL,3,CPM 'to explore every option' to block
OL,4,Cearly release of PC Harper's killers
OL,6,FHe was dragged down a country road as
OL,7,Fthe three teenage suspects, including
OL,8,Fpassengers Jessie Cole and Albert
OL,9,FBowers, fled the scene of the burglary.
OL,11,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,12,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,13,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,14,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,16,FCole and Bowers were convicted of
OL,17,Fmanslaughter in 2020, and under
OL,18,Fcurrent plans, are eligible to be
OL,19,Ffreed halfway through their 13-year
OL,20,Fsentences.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
