OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786229319
OL,3,CPM 'to explore every option' to block
OL,4,Cearly release of PC Harper's killers
OL,6,FPrime minister Andy Burnham is
OL,7,Fprepared to "explore every option" to
OL,8,Fkeep them both in prison, a government
OL,9,Fsource told the Telegraph on Friday.
OL,11,FThe government has so far resisted
OL,12,Fpressure to exempt the two killers
OL,13,Ffrom its early release scheme, which
OL,14,Fwill start in October in a bid to
OL,15,Ftackle prison overcrowding.
OL,26,@oD@MOUoD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
