OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786229319
OL,3,CPM 'to explore every option' to block
OL,4,Cearly release of PC Harper's killers
OL,6,FBurnham said earlier this week he had
OL,7,F"pushed to the very limits of what is
OL,8,Fpossible to do without risking the
OL,9,Fprison system reaching capacity and
OL,10,Fcollapsing" by excluding sentences for
OL,11,F"rape, serious child sex offences and
OL,12,Fother grooming offences" from
OL,13,Feligibility.
OL,15,FAround 5,000 people are expected to be
OL,16,Freleased early under the scheme, down
OL,17,Ffrom 6,000 after the exemptions were
OL,18,Fannounced as part of an urgent review.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@KO]sD@AOUtD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
