OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786229319
OL,3,CPM 'to explore every option' to block
OL,4,Cearly release of PC Harper's killers
OL,6,FPC Harper's family have expressed
OL,7,Fanger and disappointment at the
OL,8,Fdecision not to exempt Cole and Bowers
OL,9,Ffrom the plans, with his mum Debbie
OL,10,FAdlam telling ITV News she was
OL,11,F"devastated" by the news.
OL,13,F"It's a different kind of thing that
OL,14,FI'm dealing with. We've been so much,
OL,15,Fthe pain is always there, so it's not
OL,16,Flike it's new pain specifically," she
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786229319
OL,3,CPM 'to explore every option' to block
OL,4,Cearly release of PC Harper's killers
OL,6,F"We've got to keep going. Where we
OL,7,Fthought our task was done, it seems
OL,8,Fthat we've still got further to go.
OL,9,FAnd everything's done in Andrew's name
OL,10,Fand everything's done for justice for
OL,11,Fhim."
OL,13,FHenry Long, who was driving the car,
OL,14,Freceived a 16-year sentence and will
OL,15,Fnot be eligible for release.
OL,17,FThe early release changes are part of
OL,18,Fthe Sentencing Act, which passed
OL,19,Fearlier this year and cut the minimum
OL,20,Famount of time many offenders would
OL,21,Fhave to spend in prison.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
